  <!-- EN: Set mint chocolate cools along the grain of the steel in a pale green layer. Its cut is a little harder than plain steel, and sparks striking it raise a wisp of sweet smoke. -->
  <MCW_MintChocolateSteel.description>凝固的薄荷巧克力沿钢材纹理结成一层浅绿。切口比普通钢硬一些，火星落在上面时会冒出一缕甜烟。</MCW_MintChocolateSteel.description>
  <!-- EN: Mint chocolate steel -->
  <MCW_MintChocolateSteel.label>薄荷巧克力钢</MCW_MintChocolateSteel.label>
